** GRAMMAR :: unprofessional, non-academic, and not very good

*** VERBS


    ========
* FOOTNOTES
^ horse
  The Martian horse. The obvious redundancy in this simple phrase consists in
  the fact that there are no living horses located anywhere but upon the
  surface of Mars itself.  All horses are Martian horses.  What was once native
  to Skâr (mythical Old Yrth itself!) is not found there now. 




